## Command

```shell
biome check input.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": ["badFixKind.grit"],
  "formatter": { "enabled": false }
}
```

## `badFixKind.grit`

```grit
language js

`console.log($msg)` as $call where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $call, message = "Use console.info instead.", fix_kind = "invalid"),
    $call => `console.info($msg)`
}

```

## `input.js`

```js
console.log("hello");

```

